ected guerilla warriors in the Northwestern Tundra. They are skilled at attacking frozen Operators.","abilities":["Attack power increases when attacking Frozen targets"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":3400,"atk":360,"def":100,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"bladed_fighter":{"slug":"bladed_fighter","name":"Bladed Fighter","icon":"/enemies-icons/Bladed Fighter.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Reunion's melee soldiers who has been trained in traditional martial arts. Equipped with refitted fist weapons, they are capable of inflicting massive damage with their rapid strikes.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4000,"atk":450,"def":300,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.5}},"dual_swordsman_leader":{"slug":"dual_swordsman_leader","name":"Dual Swordsman Leader","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dual Swordsman Leader.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Reunion's melee soldiers, more dangerous than a normal Dual-bladed Swordsman. Trained in dual-wielding, it is likely that these fighters once served in the military. Their combat expertise makes them harder to deal with than the average rioter.","abilities":[],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":450,"def":120,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.2}},"infused_glacial_originium_slug_enemy_1067_snslime":{"slug":"infused_glacial_originium_slug_enemy_1067_snslime","name":"Infused Glacial Originium Slug","icon":"/enemies-icons/Infused Glacial Originium Slug.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","a