thes red to make it easier to identify them, but are also harder to deal with. Their nickname is a bit more human-sounding than 'Log Splitter,' but humans are more terrifying than any machine.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":850,"def":100,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.3}},"yeti_icecleaver":{"slug":"yeti_icecleaver","name":"Yeti Icecleaver","icon":"/enemies-icons/Yeti Icecleaver.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A special melee combatant of the Yeti Squadron hailing from teams of infected gerilla warriors in the Northwestern Tundra. Grim reapers on the battlefield, they wield long katanas that can easily ravage frozen Operators, hence the nickname they've been given, 'Ice Cleaver.'","abilities":["Attack power increases greatly when attacking Frozen targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":830,"def":500,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"frost":{"slug":"frost","name":"Frost","icon":"/enemies-icons/Frost.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An unmanned enemy drone equipped with heavy armor to make it harder to destroy. Its prototype was designed by a graphics engine studio. They are equipped with a special device that allows them to drastically reduce the temperature around them, greatly decreasing the attack speed of nearby Operators.","abilities":["Flying unit.","All friendly units within range have reduced ASPD"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":100,"def":600,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"faust":{"slug":"faust","name":"